return ['domain'=>'zinn-connector','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'so_SO','project-id-version'=>'zinn-connector','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-10-01T20:50:35+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-10-01T20:50:35+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Connector'=>'Zinn® Connector','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-connector'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-connector','Connects this WordPress site to Zinn Digital® so scheduled articles can be published to it. Paste a pairing code from your Zinn® dashboard and the plugin sets up its own credential — nothing is copied by hand.'=>'Waxay goobtan WordPress ku xiraysaa Zinn Digital® si maqaallada loo qorsheeyay loogu daabaco. Ka soo dheji koodhka lammaanaynta dashboard-kaaga Zinn® oo plugin-ku wuxuu samaysanayaa aqoonsigiisa u gaarka ah — waxba gacanta laguma koobiyeeyo.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Stored. Type a new value to replace it.'=>'Waa la keydiyay. Ku qor qiimo cusub si aad ugu beddesho.','Filter this list…'=>'Kala soco liiskan…','Filter this list'=>'Kala saar liiskan','Nothing matches that filter.'=>'Waxba kalama mid ma aha miirahaas.','Add a row'=>'Ku dar saf','Remove this row'=>'Ka saar safkan','Remove'=>'Ka saar','Zinn Digital®'=>'Zinn Digital®','Zinn Digital® — overview'=>'Zinn Digital® — dulmar','Overview'=>'Dulmar guud','Copied'=>'Waa la koobiyey','Every Zinn® plugin on this site, and whether it is working.'=>'Xubin kasta oo Zinn® ah oo ku taal boggan, iyo haddii ay shaqeyneyso.','No connection is needed for this plugin.'=>'Xiriir looma baahna furahaan.','Open settings'=>'Fur habaynta','You do not have permission to change these settings.'=>'Uma lihid ogolaansho inaad bedesho goobahan.','Settings sections'=>'Qaybaha habaynta','Support'=>'Taageero','Save changes'=>'Kaydi isbeddelada','Tools'=>'Qalabka','Export settings'=>'Dhoofi habaynta','Reset to defaults'=>'Dib ugu celi sidii hore','This puts every setting on this plugin back to its default. Continue?'=>'Tani waxay dib ugu celinaysaa dhammaan habaynta plugin-kan sidii hore. Ma sii wadaa?','Diagnostics for support'=>'Baaritaanka taageerada','Import a settings file'=>'Soo geli faylka habaynta','Import'=>'Soo geli','Exported files never contain passwords, tokens or API keys — you will need to enter those again on the new site.'=>'Faylasha la dhoofiyay waligood kuma jiraan ereyo sir ah, tokens ama furayaasha API — waxaad u baahan doontaa inaad kuwaas dib uga galiso goobta cusub.','Settings saved.'=>'Dhaqangelinta waa la keydiyay.','Every setting on this plugin is back to its default.'=>'Dejinta kasta oo ku saabsan furitaankan waxay ku noqotay sidii hore loogu talagalay.','Done.'=>'Waa dhammaatay.','That action is not available.'=>'Falkaasi ma heli karo.','That file could not be read. Choose a settings file exported from a Zinn® plugin.'=>'Faylkaas lama akhriyi karin. Dooro faylka habaynta ee laga soo dhoofiyay furin Zinn®.','That file is too large to be a settings export.'=>'Faylkaasi aad buu ugu weyn yahay inuu noqdo dhoofin habayneed.','That file is not a Zinn® settings export.'=>'Faylkaasi ma aha dhoofinta habaynnada Zinn®.','That file was exported from a different plugin (%s), so importing it here would store settings this plugin does not understand.'=>'Faylkaas waxaa laga soo dhoofiyay furin (plugin) kale (%s), sidaa darteed halkan oo lagu soo dejiyo waxay kaydinaysaa habaynno aysan furintani fahmin.','%d setting imported. Passwords and API keys are never in an export, so enter those again.'=>'%d habayn ayaa la soo dejiyay. Erayada sirta ah iyo furayaasha API waligood kuma jiraan xogta la dhoofiyo, markaa dib u geli kuwaas.' . "\0" . '%d habayn ayaa la soo dhoofiyay. Furaha sirta ah iyo furayaasha API waligood kuma jiraan dhoofinta, markaa dib u geli kuwaas.','The archive would be %1$d MB, over the %2$d MB limit set on this site. Raise the limit, or exclude some folders, on the Zinn Digital® → Connector → Backups screen.'=>'Kaydku wuxuu noqonayaa %1$d MB, taasoo ka badan xadka %2$d MB ee loogu talagalay goobtan. Kordhi xadka, ama ka saar faylal qaar, shaashadda Zinn Digital® → Connector → Backups.','This site\'s PHP cannot create archives, so a backup could not be made.'=>'PHP-ga goobtan ma abuuri karo kayd feylal ah (archives), sidaas darteed lama samayn karin koobi kayd ah (backup).','Could not create a temporary file.'=>'Lama abuuri karin fayl ku meel gaar ah.','This site\'s files could not be archived.'=>'Faylasha goobtan lama kaydin karin.','This site\'s PHP cannot compress archives, so a backup could not be made.'=>'PHP-ga boggani ma cufi karo faylasha kaydka ah, sidaa darteed nuqul kayd ah lama samayn karin.','A backup of this site needs about %1$s of temporary space and only %2$s is free, so it was not attempted.'=>'Kaydinta goobtan waxay u baahan tahay qiyaastii %1$s oo ah meel ku meel gaar ah waxaana bannaan kaliya %2$s, sidaas darteed lama isku dayin.','This WordPress user cannot publish posts, so a connection made now could not publish either. Sign in as a user who can, and try again.'=>'Isticmaalahaan WordPress ma daabaci karo qoraallo, sidaas darteed xiriir hadda la sameeyo isna wax ma daabaci karo. Soo gal adigoo ah isticmaale awood u leh, ka dibna mar kale isku day.','Application passwords are turned off on this site, so we cannot create a credential. Ask your host to enable them, or connect the site with a password you create yourself in your Zinn Digital® dashboard.'=>'Furaha sirta ah ee codsiga waa laga damiyay boggan, sidaa darteed ma abuuri karno aqoonsi. Weydiiso martigeliyahaaga inuu awood u yeelo, ama ku xidh bogga furaha sirta ah oo aad adigu ku abuurto khaanaddaada Zinn Digital®.','WordPress would not create a credential for this site. Nothing has been sent anywhere.'=>'WordPress ma abuuri karo aqoonsi goobtan ah. Waxba meelna looma dirin.','We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this site. Nothing was connected, and the credential we made has been removed. Check the site can make outgoing requests, and try again.'=>'Kama aannu gaari karin Zinn Digital® goobtan. Waxba lama xiriirin, aqoonsigii aan abuurnayna waa la saaray. Hubi in goobtu samayn karto codsiyo baxaya, ka dibna isku day mar kale.','Zinn Digital® could not finish connecting this site. The problem is on our side, not with your pairing code — nothing was connected, and the credential we made has been removed. The same pairing code still works: try again in a few minutes.'=>'Zinn Digital® ma dhamaystirin karin ku xiridda goobtan. Dhibaatadu waxay ka timid dhankayaga, ee ma aha koodhkaaga isku xirka — waxba lama xirin, aqoonsigii aan abuurnayna waa la saaray. Isla koodhkii isku xirka ayaa weli shaqeynaya: isku day mar kale dhowr daqiiqo ka dib.','Zinn Digital® did not accept that pairing code. Nothing was connected. Generate a fresh code in your dashboard and try again.'=>'Zinn Digital® ma uusan aqbalin lambarkaas isku-xirka. Waxba lama xiriirin. Ka samee kood cusub dashboard-kaaga oo mar kale isku day.','Connected. Zinn Digital® can now publish to this site.'=>'Waa lagu xiray. Zinn Digital® hadda wuxuu wax ku daabaci karaa boggan.','Connected'=>'Ku xiran','Connecting…'=>'Isku xiraya…','Connected, but something needs attention'=>'Waa ku xidhan yahay, laakiin wax baa u baahan feejignaan','Not connected'=>'Kuma xirna','Running on your own account'=>'Ku shaqeynaya koontadaada gaarka ah','We could not check this'=>'Ma aanan hubin karin tan','This plugin did not say why. Send a diagnostics report and we will look.'=>'Furintaan ma aysan sheegin sababta. Soo dir warbixinta baaritaanka annaguna waan eegi doonnaa.','Connection status'=>'Xaaladda xiriirka','Last checked %s ago.'=>'Baaritaankii ugu dambeeyay %s kahor.','(opens in a new tab)'=>'(wuxuu ku furmayaa tab cusub)','Send this to Zinn® support'=>'U dir tan taageerada Zinn®','This is exactly what will be sent — nothing else, and nothing hidden. Your passwords, tokens and API keys are not in it.'=>'Tani waa sida dhabta ah waxa la diri doono — wax kale ma jiraan, wax qarsoonina ma jiraan. Furahaaga sirta ah, calaamadahaaga iyo furayaashaada API kuma jiraan.','The diagnostics report that will be sent'=>'Warbixinta ogaanshaha cudurka ee la diri doono','Copy to clipboard'=>'Nuqul u qaad sabuuradda','Send this report to Zinn® support'=>'U dir warbixintan taageerada Zinn®','We open a support ticket for you and reply by email. If you would rather not send it, copy it above and paste it into a ticket yourself.'=>'Waxaan kuu furaynaa tigidhka caawinta waxaanan kaga jawaabaynaa iimayl. Haddii aad doorbiddo inaadan dirin, kor ka koobiyeeso oo adigu geli tigidh.','We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this server (%s). Copy the report above and open a ticket instead — nothing about your settings is wrong.'=>'Kuma aanan gaari karin Zinn Digital® adeegahan (%s). Nuqul ka qaad warbixinta sare oo taa beddelkeeda fur tigidh — wax khalad ah oo ku jira habayntaada ma jiraan.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report and will reply by email.'=>'Waa la diray. Qaybta caawinta ee Zinn® waxay heshay warbixintaada waxayna kaga jawaabi doontaa iimayl.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report — reference %s — and will reply by email.'=>'Waa la diray. Taageerada Zinn® waxay heshay warbixintaada — tixraac %s — waxayna kaga soo jawaabi doontaa iimayl.','You have sent several reports in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again — the earlier ones did arrive.'=>'Waxaad dirtay dhowr warbixin waqti gaaban gudihiis. Sug dhowr daqiiqo oo mar kale isku day — kuwii hore way yimaadeen.','Zinn Digital® could not accept the report just now — that is our end, not yours. Try again shortly, or copy the report above into a ticket.'=>'Zinn Digital® ma aqbali karin warbixinta hadda — taasi waa xaggeena, ma aha xaggaaga. Isku day mar kale waxyar ka dib, ama ku koobiyeey warbixinta kore tikidh.','The report was refused (HTTP %d). Copy it above and open a ticket, quoting that number.'=>'Warbixinta waa la diiday (HTTP %d). Ka soo koobi xagga sare oo fur tigidh, adigoo sheegaya lambarkaas.','This site’s owner has turned off image uploads for Zinn Digital® in the Zinn® Connector settings.'=>'Mulkiilaha boggan wuxuu ka damiyay soo gelinta sawirrada Zinn Digital® goobaha Zinn® Connector.','This site’s owner has turned off edits to existing articles for Zinn Digital® in the Zinn® Connector settings.'=>'Mulkiilaha boggan wuxuu ka damiyay wax-ka-beddelka maqaallada jira ee Zinn Digital® xagga goobaha Zinn® Connector.','New article on your site: %s'=>'Maqaal cusub oo ku jira bartaada: %s','Zinn Digital® has added an article to your site.

Title: %1$s
Edit it: %2$s
Status: %3$s

Turn these emails off on the Zinn Digital® → Connector → Publishing screen.'=>'Zinn Digital® waxay maqaal ku dartay boggaaga.

Cinwaanka: %1$s
Wax ka beddel: %2$s
Xaaladda: %3$s

Ku dami iimaylladan shaashadda Zinn Digital® → Xiriiriyaha → Daabacaadda.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — tilmaamaha iyo adeegyada','User guides'=>'Hagayaasha isticmaalaha','Read the %s user guide'=>'Akhri hagaha isticmaalaha %s','Hide this'=>'Qari kan','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Martigelinta Zinn® ee loogu talagalay WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, koobiyeyn maalinle ah, raritaan bilaash ah iyo qaybta koontaroolka oo loo dhisay dadka maamula wax ka badan hal goob.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Suuqa Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Iibso oo iibi boggag dhisan, magacyada domain-ka iyo meelaynta xiriiriyaha, iyadoo lacagta si ammaan ah loo hayo ilaa labada dhinacba ay ku qancaan.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — shaqaaleyso dad noloshoodu ku tiirsan tahay shaqadan','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Suuqa xorta ah ee caalamiga ah: baadh in ka badan 10,000 oo adeegyo diyaarsan oo ka yimid qorayaasha, naqshadeeyayaasha, horumariyayaasha iyo khubarada SEO, ama soo dheji mashruuc oo u oggolow inay dalab ku darsadaan.','Connector'=>'Xiriiriye','Connection'=>'Xiriirka','Publishing'=>'Daabacidda','Backups'=>'Kaydka kaydinta','Advanced'=>'Heersare','Check the connection now'=>'Hubi xiriirka hadda','Disconnect this site'=>'Kala xiriirka goobtan','This revokes the credential Zinn Digital® uses, so we can no longer publish to this site. Anything already published stays. Continue?'=>'Tani waxay baabi\'inaysaa aqoonsiga ay isticmaasho Zinn Digital®, markaa mar dambe wax kuma daabaci karno goobtan. Wax kasta oo hore loo daabacay way sii jiri doonaan. Ma rabtaa inaad sii wadato?','What we may do on this site'=>'Waxa aan ka samayn karno boggan','The credential we hold is an ordinary WordPress application password, so WordPress itself decides what is possible. These narrow it further, on your side.'=>'Aqoonsiga aan hayno waa furaha sirta ah ee caadiga ah ee arjiga WordPress, markaa WordPress lafteeda ayaa go\'aamisa waxa suurtagal ah. Kuwani waxay sii koobayaan dhinacaaga.','Publish articles as'=>'Ku daabac maqaallada sida','Choose “a draft” if you would rather read everything before it goes live.'=>'Dooro "qabyo-qoraal" haddii aad doorbidid inaad wax walba akhrisatid ka hor inta aan la daabicin.','Published straight away'=>'Isla markiiba la daabacay','A draft, for me to review'=>'Qabyo, si aan u eego','Pending review'=>'Dib u eegis ayaa la sugayaa','Scheduled, using the date we send'=>'Waa la qorsheeyay, iyadoo la adeegsanayo taariikhda aan dirno','Show the author as'=>'U muuji qoraaga sida','Which of your users appears as the author. This does not change who we sign in as.'=>'Kee ka mid ah isticmaalayaashaada ayaa u muuqanaya qoraaga. Tani ma beddelayso cida aan ku galeyno.','Put articles in'=>'Ku rid maqaallada','Allow images'=>'Oggolow sawirrada','Let Zinn Digital® upload images into this site’s media library'=>'U oggolow Zinn Digital® inuu sawirrada ku shubo maktabadda warbaahinta ee boggan','Turn this off and articles arrive without their images. Nothing already uploaded is removed.'=>'Dami tan oo maqaalladu waxay ku iman doonaan sawirradooda la\'aantood. Wax horay loo soo geliyay lama saarayo.','Allow edits'=>'Oggolow wax ka beddelka','Let Zinn Digital® update an article it published before'=>'U oggolow Zinn Digital® inuu cusbooneysiiyo maqaal uu hore u daabacay','Used for corrections and re-optimisation. It never touches anything you wrote yourself.'=>'Waxaa loo adeegsadaa sixitaanka iyo dib-u-habaynta. Waligeed ma taabato wax aad adigu gacantaada ku qortay.','Tell me when something is published'=>'Ii sheeg marka wax la daabaco','Leave blank for no email. One message per article, from your own site.'=>'Faaruq uga tag haddii aadan rabin iimayl. Hal farriin maqaalkiiba, oo ka socota degelkaaga gaarka ah.','Off-site backups'=>'Koobiyada kaydka ah ee ka baxsan goobta','This site sends its own backup straight to Zinn® storage. Nothing passes through our servers on the way.'=>'Boggani wuxuu keydkiisa toos ugu diraa kaydinta Zinn®. Waxba ma maraan adeegayaashayada inta jidka lagu jiro.','Back this site up to Zinn Digital®'=>'Boggan ku kaydi Zinn Digital®','Backup token'=>'Astaanta kaydka','Paste the token shown on this site’s Backups tab in your Zinn Digital® dashboard when you chose the plugin connection. It is shown there only once; saving the connection again issues a new one.'=>'Ku dheji sumadda lagu muujiyay boggan qaybta Koobiyeynta (Backups) ee ku taal dashboard-kaaga Zinn Digital® markii aad dooratay isku xirka fur-horyaalka (plugin). Waxaa halkaas lagu muujiyaa hal mar oo keliya; dib u kaydinta xiriirintu waxay soo saaraysaa mid cusub.','Leave these out'=>'Kala reeb kuwan','One path per line, relative to wp-content — for example <code>cache</code> or <code>uploads/backups</code>. Caches and other backup plugins’ folders are the usual candidates.'=>'Hal waddo xariiq kasta, oo la xiriirta wp-content — tusaale ahaan <code>cache</code> ama <code>uploads/backups</code>. Cache-yada iyo galalka kale ee furayaasha kaydka ayaa ah musharixiinta caadiga ah.','Stop if the archive would exceed'=>'Jooji haddii kaydku ka bato','Megabytes. A shared host will usually kill a very large archive part-way; a bound turns that into a message instead of a silent failure.'=>'Megabytes. Martigeliyaha la wadaago inta badan waxa uu dhexda ku joojin doonaa kayd aad u weyn; xaddiddu taas waxay u beddeshaa fariin halkii ay ka ahaan lahayd guul-darro aamusan.','Detailed logging'=>'Diiwaangelin faahfaahsan','Record what this plugin does, for support'=>'Xog ka qor waxa qalabkani qabto, si taageero loo helo','Kept on this site, capped at the last 50 entries, and included in a diagnostics report. Turn it on before reproducing a problem.'=>'Waxaa lagu hayaa boggan, waxaana lagu xaddiday 50-kii gelin ee ugu dambeeyay, waxaana lagu daray warbixinta baaritaanka. Shid ka hor inta aadan dib u abuurin dhibaatada.','On uninstall'=>'Marka la tirtiro','Delete this plugin’s settings when it is uninstalled'=>'Tirtir habaynta qalabkan marka la tirtiro','Uninstalling never revokes the application password — that is deliberate, so uninstalling to try something else does not break your publishing. Use Disconnect above if you want the credential gone.'=>'Furista marnaba ma tirtirto erayga sirta ah ee arjiga — taasina waa ula kac, si furista si wax kale loo tijaabiyo aysan u carqaladeyn daabacaaddaada. Isticmaal Ka jar xagga sare haddii aad rabto in aqoonsigu meesha ka baxo.','The user we sign in as'=>'Isticmaalaha aan ku galno','The site’s default category'=>'Qaybta caadiga ah ee goobta','Connect this site again'=>'Dib u xiriiri goptan','Connect this site'=>'Ku xidh boggan','Open your Zinn Digital® dashboard, go to Content → Other sites, and press “Get a pairing code”. Paste it below.'=>'Fur dashboard-kaaga Zinn Digital®, aad Qoraalka → Bogagga kale, oo taabo “Hel koodhka lammaanaynta”. Ku dheji xagga hoose.','Connecting again creates a fresh credential and leaves the old one in place — use Disconnect first if you want the old one gone.'=>'Dib u xiriirintu waxay abuurtaa aqoonsi cusub waxayna kan hore kaga tagtaa meeshiisa — isticmaal Ka jar marka hore haddii aad rabto in kan hore meesha laga saaro.','Pairing code'=>'Koodhka lammaanaynta','It expires thirty minutes after you generate it, and can only be used once.'=>'Waxay dhacaysaa soddon daqiiqo ka dib markaad dhaliso, waxaana la isticmaali karaa hal mar oo keliya.','You are not allowed to connect this site.'=>'Loma oggola inaad ku xirto boggan.','This site is not connected to Zinn Digital®.'=>'Boggan kuma xiriir lama laha Zinn Digital®.','Nothing is wrong — it has simply not been paired yet. Get a pairing code from your Zinn® dashboard and paste it into this plugin’s settings.'=>'Waxba ma khaldana — si fudud weli lama lammaanayn. Ka hel koodhka lammaanaynta dashboard-kaaga Zinn® oo ku dheji goobaha furinkan.','Open my Zinn® dashboard'=>'Fur dashboard-kayga Zinn®','The connection is broken.'=>'Xiriirku waa go\'ay.','The WordPress user the credential belonged to (%s) no longer exists on this site, so nothing we send can be published. Connect again as a user who can publish.'=>'Isticmaalaha WordPress ee xogta xaqiijintu ka tirsanayd (%s) hadda kama jiro boggan, markaa waxba oo aan dirno lama daabici karo. Mar kale ku xidhnow sidii isticmaale daabici kara.','The “Zinn Digital® (publishing)” application password has been deleted from this site, so we can no longer sign in. Connect again to create a new one — nothing else was lost.'=>'Furaha sirta ah ee arjiga “Zinn Digital® (publishing)” ayaa laga tirtiray goobtan, sidaas darteed mar dambe ma geli karno. Fadlan mar kale ku xir si aad mid cusub u abuurto — wax kale ma lumin.','See this site’s application passwords'=>'Eeg ereyada sirta ah ee barnaamijka goobtan','Connected, but publishing would fail.'=>'Waa ku xidhan yahay, laakiin daabacaaddu way fashilmi doontaa.','The credential belongs to %s, and that user can no longer publish posts. Sign-in still works, so nothing looks wrong until an article is due. Give that user the ability to publish, or connect again as somebody who can.'=>'Aqoonsigan waxaa iska leh %s, isticmaalahaasina hadda kaddib ma daabici karo qoraallo. Soo gelitaanku weli wuu shaqaynayaa, sidaas darteed wax khalad ah ma muuqdaan ilaa maqaal la gaadho xilligiisa. Sii isticmaalahaas awoodda uu wax ku daabaco, ama mar kale ku xidhnow qof awood u leh.','Edit that user'=>'Wax ka beddel isticmaalahaas','Connected here — we could not reach Zinn Digital® to confirm.'=>'Halkan ayaa lagu xiray — ma aannu awoodin inaan la xiriirno Zinn Digital® si loo xaqiijiyo.','Connected, but your Zinn® account needs attention.'=>'Waa ku xidhan yahay, laakiin koontadaada Zinn® waxay u baahan tahay fiiro gaar ah.','Connected to Zinn Digital®.'=>'Ku xiran Zinn Digital®.','Connected to Zinn Digital® as %s.'=>'Waxaa lagu xiray Zinn Digital® ahaan %s.','Publishing as'=>'U daabacaya sida','Zinn® site ID'=>'Aqoonsiga goobta Zinn®','This server could not reach api.zinndigital.com (%s). That is usually a firewall or an outbound-connection rule on your host, not a problem with your Zinn® account — publishing may still be working.'=>'Serfarkani ma gaari karin api.zinndigital.com (%s). Taasi sida caadiga ah waa dab-dejiye (firewall) ama xeerka xiriirka dibadda ee martigeliyahaaga, ma aha dhibaato ku saabsan koontadaada Zinn® — daabacaaddu weli way shaqayn kartaa.','Zinn Digital® answered with an error of its own — that is our end, not yours. Publishing is unaffected while this clears.'=>'Zinn Digital® wuxuu kaga jawaabay qalad xaggiisa ah — taasi waa xaggayaga, ma aha xaggaaga. Daabacaadda ma saameynayso inta arrintan la xallinayo.','Your Zinn® account is not currently able to publish to this site. Your dashboard says why.'=>'Koontadaada Zinn® hadda ma awoodo inay wax ku daabacdo boggan. Sababta waxaa lagu sheegay muraayadaada xogta.','Zinn Digital® answered HTTP %d, which we do not recognise. Send a diagnostics report from the Support tab and we will look — do not change anything here first.'=>'Zinn Digital® wuxuu ka jawaabay HTTP %d, taas oo aynaan garanayn. Ka soo dir warbixinta baaritaanka tabka Caawinta annaguna waan eegi doonaa — marka hore waxba halkan ha ka beddelin.','Check again now'=>'Hadda mar kale hubi','Checked. The connection is live.'=>'Waa la hubiyay. Xiriirku wuu shaqaynayaa.','We could not remove the application password, so this site is still connected. Delete “Zinn Digital® (publishing)” on your profile screen and try again — we have changed nothing.'=>'Ma aanan awoodin inaan meesha ka saarno erey-sirreedka arjiga, markaa boggani weli wuu ku xiran yahay. Tirtir “Zinn Digital® (publishing)” shaashadda astaantaada oo mar kale isku day — waxba ma aannu beddelin.','Disconnected. The application password has been revoked, so Zinn Digital® can no longer publish to this site. Nothing already published was touched.'=>'Xiriirkii waa go\'ay. Furaha sirta ah ee dalabka waa laga noqday, sidaas darteed Zinn Digital® dambe wax kuma daabici karo boggan. Waxba lagama beddelin wixii hore loo daabacay.','That file could not be read from this server, so nothing was uploaded.'=>'Faylkaas lagama akhrin karin serferkan, sidaas darteed waxba lama soo gelin.','This site could not stream the upload, so nothing was sent.'=>'Boggani ma awoodin inuu si toos ah u tabiyo soo gelinta, sidaas darteed waxba lama dirin.','This file is %1$s and this site\'s PHP has no cURL, so the largest it can upload is %2$s.'=>'Faylkani waa %1$s waxaana PHP-ga goobtani aanu lahayn cURL, markaa xaddiga ugu weyn ee la geli karaa waa %2$s.','The upload could not be completed.'=>'Soo gelinta lama dhamaystiri karin.','Storage refused the upload (HTTP %d).'=>'Kaydku wuu diiday soo-gelinta (HTTP %d).','Style preset'=>'Habsocodka qaabka','A starting point. Anything below overrides it.'=>'Barta bilowga. Wax kasta oo ka hooseeya ayaa beddelaya.','Use my own colours and sizes'=>'Isticmaal midabbadayda iyo cabbirradayda gaarka ah','Leave this off and the preset is used exactly as it is.'=>'Ka tag tan iyadoo dansan oo horey-u-dejinta waxaa loo isticmaali doonaa sida ay tahay.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Eeg qoraalada warbixinta ee Zinn Digital®.','The Zinn® update service did not issue a download link for this update. Check that this site can reach the Zinn® platform, then try again.'=>'Adeegga cusboonaysiinta ee Zinn® ma soo saarin xiriirinta soo dejinta ee cusboonaysiintan. Hubi in goobtani gaari karto madal-hoosaadka Zinn®, ka dibna mar kale isku day.','The update could not be downloaded from the Zinn® update service (%s). Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Cusboonaysiinta lagama soo dejisan karin adeegga cusboonaysiinta ee Zinn® (%s). Isku day mar kale dhowr daqiiqo ka dib.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Cusboonaysiinta la soo dejiyay kuma guulaysan hubinta fayowdeeda lamana rakibin.']];